{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtopreviewandtest"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"title":"How-to Guides","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService"],"anchor":"How-to-Guides"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" calls into a real "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelInstance"},{"type":"text","text":". For previews and tests, swap it for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — an actor that records every call and exposes its history for assertions. The mock has no Mixpanel dependency and runs offline."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"In a SwiftUI preview","anchor":"In-a-SwiftUI-preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inject a mock-backed store and the analytics work flows without spinning up the SDK:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["#Preview {","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: MockMixpanelAnalyticsService())","    return ContentView().environment(store)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This requires that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore.configured"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts an injected "},{"type":"codeVoi